hadiths[49]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5379","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke insaf karney waley Allah Taala key nazdik noor key mimbaron par hongey. Rehman key dayen janib wo log jo apney faisley mein aur apney ehl-o-ayaal mein aur jiskey wali baney hon us mein insaf kartey hain. Muhammad ney apni hadees mein kaha : aur uskey dono haath dayen hain."
"5380","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : saat log hain jinhen Allah Taala qiyamat key din apney (arsh key) saaye mein jagah deyga jis din uskey saaye key siwa koi saya na hoga : insaf karney wala imam, wo jawan jo Allah Azza wa Jalla ki ibadat mein parwan chadha, wo aadmi jis ney tanhai mein Allah ko yaad kiya to uski aankhen beh padin, wo aadmi jiska dil masjid mein atka rehta hai aur do aadmi jinhoney Allah key liye mohabbat ki. aur wo aadmi jisey martabey aur khubsurti wali aurat ney apni taraf bulaya to us ney kaha : main Allah sey darta hun. aur wo aadmi jis ney sadqa diya aur usey chhupaya yahan tak ke uska bayan haath na janey ke uskey dayan haath ney kya kiya."
"5381","حدثنا أسعد بن حجير، قال: \قال رجل من الأنصار: 'ألا تعينني على من عينتَه'، فقال: 'ستقابل الذات بعدي'\""\n Narrated by Usaid bin Hudair: \""A man from among the Ansar came to the Messenger of Allah [SAW] and said: 'Will you not appoint me as you appointed so-and-so?' He said: 'You will encounter selfishness after I am gone.\"""""""
"5382","Hazrat Abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Ash'ariyon mein sey chand log merey paas aaye aur boley : hamarey sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas chalo. hamen eik kaam hai. phir main unkey sath gaya. unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! hamen apney kaam mein istemal farmaain. Abu-Musa ney farmaya : mainey unki baat sey maazirat ki aur bataya ke main nahin janta us ney mujhey sachcha jana aur mujhey maazur samjha. phir farmaya : hum apney kaam mein us sey madad nahin letey jo usey mangta hai."
"5383","Hazrat Anas Hazrat Usaid bin Huzair sey riwayat kartey hain ke ansaar mein sey eik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur bola : kya aap mujhey aamil nahin banayengey jaisa aap ney falan ko aamil banaya hai? aap ney farmaya : tum merey baad khud-gharzi dekhogey. phir sabr karna yahan tak ke mujh sey hauz par milo."
"5384","Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Samura (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ohda na mango. kyonkey agar wo tumhen mangney par diya gaya to tum uskey hawale kar diye jaogey. aur agar wo tumhen baghair mangey diya gaya to tumhari madad ki jaeygi."
"5385","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke tum anqareeb ohdey key hirs karogey. aur wo qiyamat key din sharmindagi aur hasrat hoga. kya hi achchhi doodh pilaney wali hai aur kya hi buri doodh chhudaaney wali hai."
"5386","Hazrat Abdullah bin Zuber bayan kartey hain ke banu Tameem key chand sawaar Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye. Hazrat Abu-Bakar ney farmaya : Qaqa bin Ma'bad ko ameer bana den. aur Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu ney farmaya : nahin, Aqra bin Haabis ko ameer banayen. dono mein takraar hui yahan tak ke unki aawazen buland ho gaeen. phir is barey mein ye utra : aey iman walon ! Allah aur uskey Rasool sey aagey na badho, yahan tak ke aayat khatm hui. aur agar wo sabr kartey yahan tak ke aap unkey paas bahar tashrif laatey to unkey liye behtar hota (Surah Hujurat : 1-5)."
"5387","Hazrat Hani sey riwayat hai ke jab wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye aur aap ney logon ko suna ke wo Hani ko Abu Al-Hakam kehtey hain. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen bulaya aur un sey farmaya : be-shak Allah hi Haakam hai aur faisla usi ka hai. phir tum Abu Al-Hakam kyon kehlatey ho? unhoney kaha : meri qom jab kisi chiz mein ikhtilaf karti hai to merey paas aati hai. main unkey darmiyan faisla karta hun aur dono fareeq raazi ho jaen. unhoney farmaya : ye kitna achchha hai. tumharey kitney betey hain? unhoney kaha : merey Shuraih, Abdullah aur Muslim hain. unhoney kaha : un mein sey bada kon hai? unhoney kaha : Shuraih. unhoney farmaya : phir tum Abu-Shuraih ho. phir unhoney unkey aur unki aulad key liye dua farmai."
"5388","Hazrat Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain ke mujhey Allah Taala ney eik chiz ki wajeh sey rokey rakha jo mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey suni thi jab Kisra halaak hua. aap ney farmaya : unhoney kisey janashin banaya? logon ney kaha : uski beti ko. aap ney farmaya : wo qom kabhi kamyab nahin hogi jis ney apna muamla aurat key supurd kar diya."
"5389","Hazrat Sulaiman bin Yasar Hazrat ibne-Abbas sey, wo Hazrat Fazal bin Abbas sey riwayat kartey hain ke wo Roze-Nahar ki subah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key peechhey sawaar they. Khas'am qabiley ki eik aurat aai aur boli : aey Allah key Rasool ! Allah Azza wa Jalla ka apney bandon par hajj ka fariza merey budhey baap par aisa waqt aaya hai ke wo sawari par seedha nahin beth sakta. kya main uski taraf sey hajj karun? aap ney farmaya : ji han us ney farmaya : ji han, meri taraf sey hajj kar. kyonkey agar us par qarz hota to kya tum usey ada karti? (to hajj bhi ada karo)."
"5390","Hazrat Sulaiman bin Yasar sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat ibne-Abbas ney unhen bataya ke Khas'am qabiley ki eik aurat ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey fatwa puchha jabkey Fazal Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key peechhey sawaar they. unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! Allah Azza wa Jalla ka apney bandon par hajj ka fariza unhoney us sey kaha : ji han. Abu-Abdur-Rehman ney farmaya : is hadees ko eik sey ziyada ney Zohri sey riwayat kiya hai aur unhoney us mein wo zikr nahin kiya jo Waleed bin Muslim ney zikr kiya hai."
"5391","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas sey riwayat hai ke Fazal bin Abbas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key peechhey sawaar they. phir Khas'am qabiley ki eik khubsurat aurat aai. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Fazal ka chehra dusri taraf pher diya. phir us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! Allah ka apney bandon par hajj ka fariza merey budhey baap par aisa waqt aaya hai ke wo sawari par jam kar nahin beth sakta. kya main uski taraf sey hajj karun? aap ney farmaya : ji han. aur ye hajjatul-wada mein tha."
"5392","Hazrat Sulaiman bin Yasar ney bataya ke Hazrat ibne-Abbas ney unhen bataya ke Khas'am qabiley ki eik aurat ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! Allah Azza wa Jalla ka apney bandon par hajj ka fariza merey budhey baap par aisa waqt aaya hai ke wo sawari par seedha nahin beth sakta. kya uski taraf sey mera hajj karna uskey liye kaafi hoga? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : ji han. phir Fazal uski taraf dekhney lagey jabkey wo khubsurat aurat thi. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Fazal ka chehra dusri taraf pher diya."
"5393","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey puchha : merey budhey baap par hajj aaya hai jabkey wo budhey aur kamzor hain. sawari par jam kar nahin beth saktey. agar main unhen kas kar bandhun to darta hun ke wo mar jaengey. kya main unki taraf sey hajj karun? aap ney farmaya : kya khayal hai agar un par qarz hota aur tum usey ada kartey to kya kaafi hota? unhoney kaha : ji han. aap ney farmaya : phir apney baap ki taraf sey hajj karo."
"5394","Hazrat Fazal bin Abbas sey riwayat hai ke wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key peechhey sawaar they. phir eik aadmi aaya aur bola : aey Allah key Rasool ! meri maan budhiya hain. agar main unhen uthata hun to wo jam kar nahin beth saktin. aur agar main unhen bandhun to darta hun ke unhen qatl kar dunga? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya khayal hai agar un par kya tumharey khayal mein agar tumhari maan par qarz hota to kya tum usey ada kartey? us ney kaha : ji han. aap ney farmaya : phir apni maan ki taraf sey hajj kar."
"5395","Hazrat Sulaiman bin Yasar Fazal bin Abbas sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : eik aadmi Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur bola : aey Allah key Nabi ! merey budhey baap hajj ki taqat nahin rakhtey. agar main unhen uthata hun to wo jam kar nahin beth saktey. kya main unki taraf sey hajj karun? aap ney farmaya : apney baap ki taraf sey hajj karo. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : Sulaiman ney Fazal bin Abbas sey nahin suna."
"5396","Hazrat ibne-Abbas sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur bola : merey budhey baap hajj nahin kar saktey. kya main unki taraf sey hajj karun? aap ney farmaya : ji han. kya khayal hai agar un par qarz hota aur tum usey ada kartey to kya kaafi hota?"
"5397","Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Yazeed sey riwayat hai ke eik din logon ney Hazrat Abdullah sey bahut sawal kiye. Hazrat Abdullah ney farmaya : hum par eik zamana aaya tha jab hum faisley nahin kartey they aur hum wahan nahin they. phir Allah Azza wa Jalla ney hamarey liye muqaddar farmaya ke hum us maqam tak pahunchey jo tum dekhtey ho. phir tum mein sey jisey aaj key baad faisley ka muamla pesh aaye to wo Allah ki kitab key mutabiq faisla karey. phir agar aisa muamla aaye jo Allah ki kitab mein nahin to aur jo uskey Nabi ney farmaya hai uskey mutabiq faisla karey. phir agar aisa muamla aaye jo Allah ki kitab mein nahin aur na uskey Nabi ney uskey barey mein faisla kiya to wo uskey mutabiq faisla karey jo nek logon ney farmaya. phir agar aisa muamla aaye jo Allah ki kitab mein nahin, aur na uskey Nabi ney uskey barey mein faisla kiya aur na nek logon ney uskey barey mein faisla kiya to apni raay sey ijtihad karey aur na kahey ke main darta hun, main darta hun. kyonkey halal wazeh hai aur haram wazeh hai. aur unkey darmiyan mushtabeh muamlaat hain. jo tumhen shak mein daaley usey chhod do aur jo shak mein na daaley usey lo. Abu-Abdur-Rehman ney farmaya : ye hadees jayyid hai."
"5398","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke hum par eik waqt aaya tha jab hum faisley nahin kartey they aur hum wahan nahin they. aur Allah Azza wa Jalla ney muqaddar farmaya ke hum us maqam tak pahunchey jo tum dekhtey ho. phir tum mein sey jisey faisley ka muamla pesh aaye to wo Allah ki kitab key mutabiq faisla karey. phir agar aisa muamla aaye jo Allah ki kitab mein nahin to wo uskey mutabiq faisla karey jo uskey Nabi ney farmaya. phir agar aisa muamla aaye jo Allah ki kitab mein nahin aur na uskey Nabi ney uskey barey mein faisla kiya to wo uskey mutabiq faisla karey jo nek logon ney farmaya. aur tum mein sey koi na kahey ke main darta hun, main darta hun. kyonkey halal wazeh hai aur haram wazeh hai. aur unkey darmiyan mushtabeh muamlaat hain. jo tumhen shak mein daaley usey chhod do aur jo shak mein na daaley usey lo."
"5399","Hazrat Shuraih sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Umar ko likha aur un sey puchha. unhoney unhen likha : Allah ki kitab key mutabiq faisla karo. phir agar Allah ki kitab mein na ho to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki sunnat key mutabiq. phir agar Allah ki kitab mein aur na Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki sunnat mein ho to uskey mutabiq faisla karo jo nek logon ney farmaya. phir agar na (sunnat mein) na ho aur na nek logon ney uskey barey mein faisla kiya ho to agar chahey to aagey badhey aur agar chahey to peechhey hatey. aur main peechhey hatney ko hi tumharey liye behtar samajhta hun. Wassalamu Alaikum."
"5400","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Isa bin Mariam Alaihimas-salam key baad kayi badshah huye jinhoney Tauraat aur Injeel badal din. aur un mein momin they jo Tauraat padhtey they. unkey badshahon sey kaha gaya : hum is gaali sey badi koi gaali nahin paatey jo ye hamen detey hain. wo padhtey hain : (wa man lam yahkum bima anzalAllahu ...) us ney kaha : hum is gaali sey badi koi gaali nahin paatey jo ye hamen detey hain. wo padhtey hain : (wa man lam yahkum bima anzalAllahu fa ulaaeka humul-kafirun) (Surah Maaeyda : 44). aur ye aayaat un aebon key sath jo wo hamarey aamal mein nikaltey hain, unki qiraat mein hain. unhen bulao, wo padhen jaisa hum padhtey hain aur iman layen jaisa hum iman laye. unhoney unhen bulaya aur jama kiya aur unkey saamney qatl ya Tauraat aur Injeel ki qiraat chhodney ka ikhtiyar pesh kiya siwa uskey jo unhoney badal diya tha. unhoney kaha : tum is sey kya chahtey ho, hamen chhod do. un mein sey eik giroh ney kaha : hamarey liye eik minaar banao, phir hamen us par chadha do, phir hamen kuchh do jis sey hum apna khana-peena upar uthayen aur hum tumharey paas na aayen. un mein sey eik giroh ney kaha : hamen chhod do, hum zamin mein ghoomengey aur sargardan phirengey aur piyengey jaisa jangli janwar peeta hai. phir agar tum apni zamin mein hum par qaabu pao to hamen qatl kar dena. un mein sey eik giroh ney kaha : hamarey liye jangalon mein ghar banao, hum kunwen khodengey aur sabziyan ugayengey, hum tumharey paas na aayengey aur na tumharey paas sey guzrengey. aur qabilon mein sey koi nahin magar uska un mein koi azeez hai. unhoney kaha : unhoney aisa hi kiya. Allah ney ye utara : (wa rahbaniyyatanibtadaooha ma katabnaha alaihim illabtighaa-a-rizwaanillahi fama raooha haqqa riayatiha) (Surah Hadeed : 27). aur dusron ney kaha : hum ibadat karengey jaisa falan ney ibadat ki. hum ghoomengey jaisa falan ney ghooma. hum ghar banayengey jaisa falan ney banaya. aur wo apney shirk par hain, unhen un mominon key iman ka ilm nahin jinki unhoney pairwi ki. phir jab Allah ney Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko mab'oos farmaya aur un mein sey thodey key siwa koi na bacha, eik aadmi apney girja sey utra, eik ghoomney wala apney safar sey aaya aur girja wala apney girja sey aaya. wo un par iman laye aur unki tasdeeq ki. Allah ney farmaya : (ya ayyuhallazina aamanut-taqullaha wa aaminu bi Rasulihi yu'tikum kiflaini min rahmatihi) (Surah Hadeed : 28). do ajr unkey Isa par iman, Tauraat aur Injeel par iman, aur Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) par iman aur unki tasdeeq ki wajeh sey. unhoney farmaya : (wa yajal lakum nuran tamshuna bihi) (Surah Hadeed : 28), Quran aur Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki pairwi. unhoney farmaya : (li alla ya'lamu ehlul-kitab) (Surah Hadeed : 29), wo tum sey mushabehat kartey hain ke wo Allah key fazl mein sey kisi chiz par qadir nahin. (aayat)."
"5401","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Ummey Salma sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum apney muqadmaat merey paas laatey ho. aur main bhi bashar hun. aur shayad tum mein sey koi apni hujjat mein dusrey sey ziyada tez-zaban ho. phir jiskey liye main uskey bhai key haq mein sey kuchh faisla kar dun to wo usey na ley. kyonkey main usey uski wajeh sey aag ka tukda kaat kar deta hun."
"5402","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : do aurten thin jinkey do betey they. bhediya aaya aur un mein sey eik ka beta ley gaya. is ney apni saheli sey kaha : wo tumharey betey ko ley gaya. dusri ney kaha : wo tumharey betey ko ley gaya dono Dawood Alaihissalam key paas faisley key liye gaeen to unhoney badi key haq mein faisla kiya. phir dono Sulaiman bin Dawood key paas gaeen aur unhen bataya. unhoney farmaya : merey paas chhuri lao, main usey dono key darmiyan kaat dunga. chhoti ney kaha : aisa na karo, Allah tum par reham karey, wo usi ka beta hai. to unhoney uskey haq mein faisla kiya. Abu-Hurera ney kaha : Allah ki qism ! mainey chhuri kabhi nahin suni thi siwa us din key. hum chhuri ko mudya hi kehtey they."
"5403","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke do aurten niklin jinkey do ladkey they. bhediya un mein sey eik par jhapta aur uska ladka ley gaya. phir wo baqi ladkey key barey mein Dawood Alaihissalam key paas muqadma layin. unhoney badi (umar wali) key haq mein faisla kiya. phir dono Sulaiman Alaihissalam key paas sey guzrin. unhoney farmaya unhoney kaha : tumhara kya muamla hai? dono ney unhen bataya. unhoney farmaya : merey paas chhuri lao, main ladkey ko dono key darmiyan kaat dunga. chhoti ney kaha : kya tum usey kaatogey? unhoney farmaya : ji han. us ney kaha : aisa na karo, mera hissa usi ka hai. unhoney farmaya : wo tumhara beta hai aur uskey haq mein faisla kiya."
"5404","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke do aurten niklin jinkey do ladkey they. bhediye ney un mein sey eik ko pakad liya. dono ney ladkey key barey mein Dawood Nabi Alaihissalam sey muqadma kiya. unhoney badi (umar wali) key haq mein faisla kiya. phir dono Sulaiman Alaihissalam key paas sey guzrin. unhoney farmaya unhoney kaha : tumharey darmiyan kaisey faisla kiya gaya? us ney kaha : unhoney badi key haq mein faisla kiya. Sulaiman ney farmaya : main usey do tukdey kar dunga, iskey liye aadha aur iskey liye aadha. badi ney kaha : ji han, usey kaat do. chhoti ney kaha : usey na kaato, wo usi ka beta hai. to unhoney uskey haq mein faisla kiya jis ney usey kaatney sey inkar kiya."
"5405","Hazrat Salim apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Khalid bin Waleed ko banu Jazeema ki taraf bheja. unhoney unhen Islam ki dawat di magar wo aslamna (hum musalman huye) na keh sakey. wo sahbaana (hum deen sey phir gaey) kehney lagey. Khalid unhen qatl karney lagey aur qaidi bananey lagey. unhoney kaha : unhoney har aadmi ko uska qaidi dey diya. yahan tak ke jab hamara din huwa to Khalid bin Waleed ney hukm diya ke hum mein sey har aadmi apney qaidi ko qatl kar dey. ibne-Umar ney kaha : mainey kaha Allah ki qism ! main apney qaidi ko qatl nahin karunga aur na merey sathiyon mein sey koi apney qaidi ko qatl karega. Bishr ney kaha : merey sathiyon mein sey. unhoney kaha : hum Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye aur unhen Khalid key kaam ka zikr kiya gaya. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya aur apney haath uthaye : aey Allah ! main teri taraf Khalid key kiye sey baraat ka izhaar karta hun. Zakariya ney apni hadees mein kaha : zikr kiya gaya. aur Bishr ki hadees mein : unhoney farmaya : aey Allah ! main teri taraf Khalid key kiye sey baraat ka izhaar karta hun, do baar."
"5406","Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Abi Bakra sey riwayat hai ke merey waalid ney Ubedullah bin Abi Bakra jo Sijistan key qazi they, ko likha ke do aadmiyon key darmiyan faisla na karna jab tum ghussey mein ho. kyonkey mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : koi shakhs do aadmiyon key darmiyan faisla na karey jab wo ghussey mein ho."
"5407","Hazrat Zubair bin Awwam sey riwayat hai ke unhoney ansaar mein sey eik aadmi sey jo Badr mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath hazir tha, Harra ki naali key barey mein jhagda kiya jis sey dono khajoor key darkhton ko pani detey they. Ansari ney kaha : pani chhod do. Zubair ney inkar kiya. dono ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas muqadma pesh kiya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya aap ney farmaya : aey Zubair ! pani dey, phir pani apney padosi ki taraf chhod dey. Ansari ghussa hua aur bola : aey Allah key Rasool ! kya isliye ke wo aap key phuphi ka beta hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka chehra mutaghayyar ho gaya. phir farmaya : aey Zubair ! pani dey phir pani rok ley yahan tak ke wo deewar tak wapis aaye. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Zubair ka pura haq dilwaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney is sey pehley Zubair ko aisi raay di thi jis mein uskey aur Ansari key liye gunjaaish thi. phir jab Ansari ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko ghussa dilaya to Zubair ka pura haq wazeh hukm mein dilwaya. Zubair ney kaha : mera khayal hai ke ye aayat isi barey mein utri : (fala wa Rabbika la yuminuna hatta yuhakkimuka fima shajara bainahum) (Surah Nisa : 65). aur un mein sey eik dusrey par qissey mein izafa karta hai."
"5408","Hazrat Abdullah bin Kaab apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney ibne-Abi Hadrad sey apney qarz ka taqaza kiya jo us par tha. dono ki aawazen buland ho gaeen yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen suna jabkey aap apney ghar mein they. aap unkey paas bahar tashrif laye aur apney hujrey ka parda uthaya aur aawaz di : aey Kaab ! unhoney kaha : hazir hun, aey Allah key Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam. aap ney farmaya : apney qarz mein sey itna kam kar do aur nishan aadhey ki taraf ishara kiya. unhoney kaha : mainey kar liya. aap ney farmaya : khadey ho aur ada kar do."
"5409","Hazrat Abbad bin Sharahbil sey riwayat hai ke main apney chachaon key sath Madina aaya. main unkey eik baagh mein dakhil huwa aur uski baali masal kar (daaney nikal kar khaye). baagh ka maalik aaya. us ney meri chadar chhin li aur mujhey maara. main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas uski shikayat ley kar aaya. aap ney us aadmi key paas kehla bheja. wo aaye unhoney kaha : tumhen is par kis ney ubhara? us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! wo merey baagh mein dakhil huwa aur uski baali sey ley kar masaal kiya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum ney usey nahin sikhaya jab wo jahil tha aur na usey khilaya jab wo bhooka tha. uski chadar usey wapis kar do. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney merey liye eik wasq ya aadha wasq ka hukm diya."
"5410","Hazrat Abu-Hurera aur Zaid bin Khalid Johni sey riwayat hai ke unhoney bataya ke do aadmi apna muqadma Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laye. un mein sey eik ney kaha : Allah ki kitab key mutabiq hamarey darmiyan faisla farmaain. dusrey ney jo ziyada samajhdaar tha, kaha : ji han, aey Allah key Rasool ! aur mujhey ijazat dijiye ke main bolun. aap ney farmaya aap ney farmaya : kaho. us ney kaha : mera beta is shakhs key paas mazdoor tha. us ney uski biwi sey zina kiya. mujhey bataya gaya ke merey betey par rajm hai. mainey sau bakriyon aur apni eik londi sey fidya dey diya. phir mainey ehl-e-ilm sey puchha to unhoney mujhey bataya ke merey betey par sau kodey aur eik saal ki jilawatni hai. aur rajm uski biwi par hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : qism us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai ! main tumharey darmiyan Allah ki kitab key mutabiq faisla karunga. tumhari bakriyan aur londi tumhen wapis. aur uskey betey ko sau kodey maarey aur eik saal jilawatan kiya. aur Unais ko hukm diya : dusrey ki biwi key paas jao, phir agar wo iqrar karey to usey rajm kar do. us ney iqrar kiya to usey rajm kar diya."
"5411","Hazrat Abu-Hurera, Zaid bin Khalid aur Shibl sey riwayat hai ke hum Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas they. eik aadmi khada huwa aur bola : main aap ko Allah ki qism deta hun ke hamarey darmiyan Allah ki kitab key mutabiq faisla farmaain. uska hareef jo us sey ziyada samajhdaar tha, khada huwa aur bola : us ney sach kaha. hamarey darmiyan Allah ki kitab key mutabiq faisla farmaain. aap ney farmaya : kaho. us ney kaha : mera beta is shakhs key paas mazdoor tha. us ney uski biwi sey zina kiya us ney kaha : mera beta is shakhs key paas mazdoor tha. us ney uski biwi sey zina kiya. mainey us sey sau bakriyon aur khadim sey fidya dey diya. goya usey bataya gaya tha ke uskey betey par rajm hai to us ney fidya dey diya. phir mainey ehl-e-ilm mein sey chand mardon sey puchha to unhoney mujhey bataya ke merey betey par sau kodey aur eik saal ki jilawatni hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : qism us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai ! main tumharey darmiyan Allah ki kitab key mutabiq faisla karunga. sau bakriyan aur khadim tumhen wapis. aur tumharey betey par sau kodey aur eik saal ki jilawatni hai. aey Unais ! subah iski biwi key paas jao, phir agar wo iqrar karey to usey rajm kar do. wo subah uskey paas gaya to us ney iqrar kiya to usey rajm kar diya."
"5412","Hazrat Abu-Umama bin Sahal bin Hunaif sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik aurat lai gaee jo zina kar chuki thi. aap ney farmaya : kis sey? us ney kaha : Saad key baagh mein rehne waley ma'zoor (mazoor) sey. aap ney usey bulwaya. usey uthaya kar laya gaya aur aap key saamney rakha gaya. us ney iqrar kar liya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ithkaal (khajoor ki tehni jis mein khajooren lagi hon) mangwaya. usey maara aur us par reham kiya, uski mazuri aur halki (saza) ki wajeh sey."
"5413","Hazrat Sahal bin Saad Saaidi sey riwayat hai ke ansaar key do qabail mein baat badh gaee yahan tak ke unhoney eik dusrey par pathar barsaye. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) unkey darmiyan sulah karaney tashrif ley gaey. namaz ka waqt ho gaya. Hazrat Bilal ney azan kahi aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka intezar kiya gaya. aap ruk gaey to namaz ki iqamat ho gaee aur Hazrat Abu-Bakar Raziallahu anhu aagey badhey. phir Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) tashrif laye jab logon ney unhen dekha to unhoney taaliyan bajayen. Hazrat Abu-Bakar namaz mein iltifat nahin kartey they. phir jab unhoney unki taaliyon ki aawaz suni to iltifat kiya to dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) hain. unhoney chaha ke peechhey haten to unhoney unhen ishara kiya ke qayam raho. Hazrat Abu-Bakar ney yani apney haath uthaye. phir peechhey hatey. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) aagey badhey aur namaz padhai. phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) namaz sey farigh huye to farmaya : tumhen qayam rehney sey kis ney roka? unhoney kaha : ibne-Abi Quhafa ko Allah apney Nabi key aagey na dekhey (ye mumkin nahin). phir logon ki taraf mutawajjeh huye aur farmaya : tumhen kya hai ke jab tumhen namaz mein koi muamla pesh aata hai to taaliyan bajatey ho. ye to aurton key liye hai. jisey namaz mein koi muamla pesh aaye wo Subhan Allah kahey."
"5414","Hazrat Kaab bin Malik sey riwayat hai ke unka Abdullah bin Abi Hadrad Aslami par qarz tha, yani deen. wo usey miley aur us sey taqaza kiya. dono mein baat badh gaee yahan tak ke aawazen buland ho gaeen. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) unkey paas sey guzrey aur farmaya : aey Kaab ! phir aap ney apney haath sey ishara kiya aur haath sey ishara kiya goya kehtey : aadha. unhoney jo us par tha uska aadha liya aur aadha chhod diya."
"5415","Hazrat Waeyl sey riwayat hai ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko dekha jab maqtool ka waris qatil ko rassi mein jakad kar laya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney maqtool key waris sey farmaya : kya tum usey muaf kartey ho? us ney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : kya diyat logey? us ney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : kya usey qatl karogey? us ney kaha : ji han aap ney farmaya : kya diyat logey? us ney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : kya usey qatl karogey? us ney kaha : ji han. aap ney farmaya : usey ley jao. phir jab wo gaya aur unkey paas sey peeth pher kar gaya to unhoney usey bulaya. us ney farmaya : kya tum usey muaf kartey ho? us ney kaha : nahin. us ney farmaya : kya diyat logey? us ney kaha : nahin. us ney farmaya : kya usey qatl karogey? us ney kaha : ji han. us ney farmaya : usey ley jao. phir jab wo gaya aur unkey paas sey peeth pher kar gaya to unhoney usey bulaya. us ney farmaya : kya tum usey muaf kartey ho? us ney kaha : nahin. us ney farmaya : kya diyat logey? us ney kaha : nahin. us ney farmaya : kya usey qatl karogey? us ney kaha : ji han. us ney farmaya : usey ley jao. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usi waqt farmaya : khabardaar ! agar tum ney usey muaf kar diya to wo apney gunah aur tumharey sathi key gunah ka bojh uthayega. phir us ney usey muaf kar diya aur chhod diya. main ney usey apni rassi ghaseet-tey huye dekha."
"5416","Hazrat Urwa sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abdullah bin Zuber ney unhen bataya ke ansaar mein sey eik aadmi ney Hazrat Zuber sey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas Harra ki naali key barey mein jhagda kiya jis sey dono khajoor key darkhton ko pani detey they. Ansari ney kaha : pani chhod do taake guzar jaey. Zubair ney inkar kiya. dono ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas muqadma pesh kiya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya Zubair ney kaha : mera khayal hai ke ye aayat isi barey mein utri : (fala wa Rabbika la yuminun) (Surah Nisa : 65), aayat."
"5417","Hazrat ibne-Abbas sey riwayat hai ke Barira ka khawind ghulam tha jisey Mughis kaha jata tha. goya main usey dekh raha hun ke wo uskey peechhey rota hua phir raha hai jabkey uskey aansu uski dadhi par beh rahey hain. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat Abbas sey farmaya : aey Abbas ! kya tumhen Mughis ki Barira sey mohabbat aur Barira ki Mughis sey nafrat par taajjub nahin? phir Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : kaash tum rujoo kar letin us sey kaha : kaash tum us sey rujoo kar letin kyonkey wo tumharey bachchey ka baap hai. us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! kya aap mujhey hukm detey hain? aap ney farmaya : main to sifarishi hun. us ney kaha : mujhey us mein koi hajat nahin."
"5418","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke ansaar mein sey eik aadmi ney apna eik ghulam mudabbir kiya jabkey wo mohtaj tha aur us par qarz tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey aath sau dirham mein becha aur (qeemat) usey dey di aur farmaya : apna qarz ada karo aur apney ehl-o-ayaal par kharch karo."
"5419","Hazrat Abu-Umama sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs jhooti qism sey kisi musalman ka haq maar ley to Allah ney uskey liye aag wajib kar di hai aur us par jannat haram kar di hai. eik aadmi ney aap sey kaha : chahey mamuli chiz ho, aey Allah key Rasool? aap ney farmaya : chahey araak ki tehni hi kyon na ho."
"5420","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Hind Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aai aur boli : aey Allah key Rasool ! Abu-Sufiyan kanjus aadmi hai. wo mujh par aur merey bachchey par itna kharch nahin karta jo mujhey kaafi ho. kya main uskey maal mein sey uski be-khabri mein ley lun? aap ney farmaya : jo tumhen aur tumharey bachchey ko dastoor key mutabiq kaafi ho wo ley lo."
"5421","Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Abi Bakra jo Sijistan key aamil they, sey riwayat hai ke mujhey Abu-Bakra ney likha : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : koi shakhs eik faisley mein do faisley na karey. aur koi shakhs do jhagadney walon key darmiyan faisla na karey jab wo ghussey mein ho."
"5422","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Ummey Salma sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum apney muqadmaat merey paas laatey ho. aur main bhi bashar hun. aur shayad tum mein sey koi apni hujjat mein dusrey sey ziyada tez-zaban ho. phir main tumharey darmiyan usi key mutabiq faisla karta hun jo sunta hun. phir jiskey liye main uskey bhai key haq mein sey kuchh faisla kar dun to wo usey na ley. kyonkey main usey uski wajeh sey aag ka tukda kaat kar deta hun."
"5423","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah key nazdik mardon mein sab sey napasandida sakht jhagdaalu hai."
"5424","Hazrat Abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke do aadmi apna muqadma Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laye jiska talluq eik janwar sey tha. dono mein sey kisi key paas gawah nahin tha. aap ney uskey barey mein faisla farmaya ke wo dono mein aadha aadha hai."
"5425","Hazrat ibne-Abi Mulaika sey riwayat hai ke Taif mein chamda rangney wali do londiyan thin. un mein sey eik nikli jabkey uska haath khoon-aalud tha. us ney gumaan kiya ke uski saheli ney usey zakhmi kiya hai jabkey dusri ney inkar kiya. mainey is barey mein Hazrat ibne-Abbas ko likha. unhoney likha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke qism mudda-alaih par hai. aur agar logon ko unkey daawey par (sab kuchh) diya jata usey bulao aur us par ye aayat padho : (innallazina yashtaruna bi ahdillahi wa aymanihim samanan qaleelan, ulaaeka la khalaqa lahum fil-aakhirah) (Surah Aal-e-Imran : 77), aayat key aakhir tak. mainey usey bulaya aur us par padha to us ney iqrar kar liya. ye usey achchha laga."
"5426","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Muawiya Raziallahu anhu ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) apney sahaba key eik halqey par bahar tashrif laye, yani un mein sey. aap ney farmaya : tumhen kis ney bithaya hai? unhoney kaha : hum bethey Allah sey dua kar rahey hain aur us par uski hamd kar rahey hain ke us ney hamen apney Deen ki hidayat di aur hum par aap key (waseeley sey) ehsaan farmaya. aap ney farmaya : kya Allah ki qism ! tumhen isi ney bithaya hai? unhoney kaha : Allah ki qism ! tumhen isi ney bithaya hai? unhoney kaha : Allah ki qism ! hamen isi ney bithaya hai. aap ney farmaya : khabardaar ! mainey tum sey tohmat ki wajeh sey qism nahin li. lekin merey paas Jibraeel Alaihissalam aaye aur unhoney mujhey khabar di ke Allah Azza wa Jalla tum par farishton mein fakhr farmata hai."
"5427","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Isa bin Mariam Alaihissalam ney eik aadmi ko chori kartey dekha. unhoney us sey farmaya : kya tum ney chori ki? us ney kaha : nahin. qism us Allah ki jiskey siwa koi mabud nahin. Isa Alaihissalam ney farmaya : main Allah par iman laya aur apni aankh ko jhutlaya."
